```console
$ scherzo-cloud workflow --help
Work with local workflow definitions and runs

Usage: scherzo-cloud workflow [COMMAND]

Commands:
  retry     Retry a local workflow run
  run       Run a local command and agent workflow
  schema    Show the workflow structural schema
  status    Show local workflow run status
  validate  Validate a local workflow definition
  view      View a published local workflow attempt
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
